        }
      }
    },
    "If you cannot find a number after a while, scan vertically and horizontally." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ある程度の時間探して見つからない時は縦・横に目線を移して探しましょう"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you make a mistake, take a deep breath before continuing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "間違えても焦らず、深呼吸してから再開しましょう"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make sure your hand or stylus does not cover the grid." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手やペン先で隠れてしまわないように注意しましょう"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Personal Best!" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自己ベスト更新！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next →" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "次に押す数字→"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No history yet" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "履歴はありません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please tap the correct number." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正しい数字をタップしてください"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prioritize unscanned areas over re-checking the same spots." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同じ場所を何度も見るより、まだ見ていないエリアを優先して探しましょう"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Relax your shoulders and stay calm." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "肩の力を抜いてリラックスしましょう"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan the whole grid rather than fixating on one spot." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "視線を1点に集中せず、全体を見渡す感覚で探しましょう"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotting the next number ahead of time makes the search more efficient." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先の数字を見つけておくことで、効率的に探せます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開始する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start from the 0 at the center." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "始めは中央の0からスタートとなります"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Test" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "検査開始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start the test?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "検査を開始しますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay calm." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "落ち着いて。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop the test?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "検査を中断しますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking in a wide area at once matters more than moving your eyes quickly." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "視線を素早く動かすより、広い範囲を一度に見る意識が大切です"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap numbers from 0 to 48 in order." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "0から48までの数字を順番にタップしていきます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tension narrows your field of vision. Take a deep breath before starting." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "緊張すると視野が狭くなります。検査前に深呼吸して"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test Complete" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "検査終了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next number may be right next to the last one." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数字がすぐ近くにあることも"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This action cannot be undone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この操作は取り消せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ワンポイントアドバイス"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "もう一度挑戦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try scanning outward from the center in a radial pattern." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中央から放射状に視線を広げる探し方も有効です"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Well done!" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "お疲れさまでした"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When your score plateaus, prioritize accuracy over speed." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "スコアが伸びない時こそ、急がず正確さを優先しましょう"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With practice, your eye movement becomes more efficient and your time improves." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "練習を重ねると目線の移動が効率化され、タイムが自然と縮みます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You do not need to memorize the layout. Calmly search one number at a time." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数字の配置を覚える必要はありません。冷静に1つずつ探しましょう"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}